21 0 obj
<<
/Title (Rather than replacing traditional programming, low-code complements it by accelerating the development of internal tools, automation solutions, and business applications. Many organizations now adopt a hybrid approach, using traditional development for mission-critical systems while leveraging low-code platforms like UiPath for rapid automation and workflow management. Choosing the right approach ultimately depends on project complexity, timeline, budget, and long-term business objectives.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 206 0 R
>>
