/T ( Conclusion Traditional Development and Low-Code Development each serve different business needs. Traditional development provides maximum flexibility, scalability, and control, making it the preferred choice for complex, enterprise-grade applications. In contrast, low-code development focuses on speed, simplicity, and cost efficiency, enabling organizations to build applications quickly with minimal coding.)
/E ( Conclusion Traditional Development and Low-Code Development each serve different business needs. Traditional development provides maximum flexibility, scalability, and control, making it the preferred choice for complex, enterprise-grade applications. In contrast, low-code development focuses on speed, simplicity, and cost efficiency, enabling organizations to build applications quickly with minimal coding.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
